# Knowledge-Learning Cursor Rules

## Source-Grounding
- STRICT_SOURCE_MODE is enabled by default
- All outputs must include [Source: ...] citations
- Mark unverified claims with [unverified]

## Learning Workflow
- Import materials with /import
- Learn with /learn or /study
- Review with /review and /flashcard
- Track progress with /track

## Note Format
- Atomic notes with YAML frontmatter
- Include source, tags, domain, and confidence fields
- Use [[wiki-link]] for connections
